Z||000009||Will||01-09-2001||09:45 AM||||There are electronic transmission controllers all over the place. I'll try to post some resources for you this weekend.<P>I don't know how well a 4t60 would stand up behind a Northstar. 3.4 TDC's go through 4T60's left and right. I think the reason they have some semblance of a lifetime in Caddies is that your average Caddy owner uses full throttle about once every five years. I'd say it's definitely going to need beefing up to handle a Northstar. Why do you think they came out with the 4T80E?<P>Since you're not using the stock electronics, there's no reason you can't use a Getrag. Unless you <I>want</I> an Auto...<p>[This message has been edited by Will (edited 01-09-2001).]||||reg||1
